# NOTE: deliberately NOT ignoring all of data/ -- the JSON reports and figures
# under data/update2_output/ are tracked on purpose so the dashboard works
# without re-running the pipeline. A bare `data/` rule would silently drop new
# artifacts from commits.
data/*.parquet
